# Send these one at a time, from top to bottom, while the API runs (dotnet run).
# Bookings must be within the next 7 days, so set @date to tomorrow first.
# You can also try every request from the browser at http://localhost:5080/scalar.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@date = 2026-10-21

### All rooms
GET {{host}}/rooms

### Everything wrong at once: 10:10 is not on the 30 minute step, it lasts too long,
### it ends after closing time, and there is no user zoe (400 with every problem listed)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "date": "{{date}}",
  "start": "10:10",
  "end": "23:00",
  "userId": "zoe",
  "joinPolicy": "Open"
}

### Ana books A101 (capacity 3) from 10:00 to 12:00, and anyone may join (201 Created)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "date": "{{date}}",
  "start": "10:00",
  "end": "12:00",
  "userId": "ana",
  "joinPolicy": "Open"
}

### Mihai joins (200, one place left)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "mihai" }

### Ioana joins (200, the booking is full now)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ioana" }

### Radu tries to join (409, the booking is full)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "radu" }

### What other students see: display names, no ids or emails
GET {{host}}/timetable?date={{date}}

### Ioana leaves (200, a place is free again)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/leave
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ioana" }

### Ana cannot leave her own booking (409)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/leave
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ana" }

### Radu tries to remove Mihai, but only the owner can (403 Forbidden)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/participants/mihai/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "radu" }

### Ana removes Mihai (200)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/participants/mihai/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ana" }

### Mihai cannot join again after being removed (409)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "mihai" }

### Radu makes a private booking in B204 (201)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 3,
  "date": "{{date}}",
  "start": "14:00",
  "end": "15:00",
  "userId": "radu",
  "joinPolicy": "Private"
}

### Nobody can join a private booking (409)
POST {{host}}/bookings/2/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ana" }

### Ana cancels her booking (200, the status is Cancelled)
POST {{host}}/bookings/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ana" }

### To see the 2 hour limit on cancelling: book a room for today, starting less than
### 2 hours from now (change the date and the times below), then cancel it (409)
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 2,
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "start": "12:00",
  "end": "12:30",
  "userId": "ioana",
  "joinPolicy": "Open"
}

### Cancel the booking above (use the id it came back with)
POST {{host}}/bookings/3/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": "ioana" }
